      <p>These General Conditions of Use (&ldquo;GCU&rdquo; or &ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) define the conditions under which you (the &ldquo;User&rdquo; or &ldquo;you&rdquo;) may access and use PARKIWATCH, a Class IIa Software as a Medical Device under EU MDR 2017/745, and any associated mobile application, web dashboard or services (collectively, the &ldquo;Koios Care Service&rdquo; or &ldquo;Service&rdquo;) offered by Koios Care BV (&ldquo;Company,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;).</p>
