      <h2>Article 2: Definitions</h2>
      <p><strong>Koios Care BV</strong> (or &ldquo;we&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;): refers to the company Koios Care BV, a Belgian company with registered office at Filip Williotstraat 9, 2600 Antwerpen, with VAT number BE0786.830.148.</p>
      <p><strong>GCU:</strong> these General Conditions of Use.</p>
      <p><strong>User</strong> (or &ldquo;you&rdquo;): the natural person using the Koios Care Service in accordance with its intended purpose.</p>
      <p><strong>Koios Care Service</strong> (or &ldquo;Service&rdquo;): refers to PARKIWATCH, a Class IIa Software as a Medical Device under EU MDR 2017/745, its associated mobile application(s), web dashboard, software, content, and any related services provided by the Company.</p>
      <p><strong>Biometric Data:</strong> refers to heart rate variability, skin temperature, activity levels, sleep patterns, and electrothermal activity collected through the Koios Care device and/or app.</p>
